SUMMARY:Kids and Family Pride Fest
DESCRIPTION:Kids & Family Pride Fest is a community celebration of diversity\, inclusion\, and belonging for children\, youth\, and their families. The event will feature family-friendly entertainment\, activities\, a vendor market \, and opportunities to connect with others in a welcoming and affirming environment. The festival is open to everyone and aims to celebrate the many ways people and families can be themselves with pride. Proceeds and donations from the event will support Friends of Ruby.
URL:https://beachmetro.com/event/kids-and-family-pride-fest/
LOCATION:Beaches Presbyterian Church\, 65 Glen Manor Drive\, Toronto\, M4E 3V3
